Description: High-performance SoundCloud downloader CLI
 SounCdown is a modern, fast command-line tool for downloading audio
 from SoundCloud with automatic format conversion and metadata embedding.
 .
 Features:
  - Download single tracks and playlists
  - Automatic playlist detection
  - Multiple output formats (MP3, WAV, FLAC, etc.)
  - Thumbnail and metadata embedding
  - Playlist track numbering
  - OAuth token support for private content
  - Real-time progress tracking
 .
 Built with modern C++20 for maximum performance and reliability.
